WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.856 --> 00:00:02.856
♪♪

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:07.391
M'BAKU
The Black Panther lives!

00:00:08.936 --> 00:00:10.327
RYAN COOGLER
The way we went about making the first

00:00:10.378 --> 00:00:13.873
movie was with as much respect for 
the cultures that we were pulling from.

00:00:14.897 --> 00:00:19.061
We wanted to do the same thing for the 
cultures that we were reflecting in this.

00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:23.618
LETITIA WRIGHT
I'm excited about the new characters

00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:25.317
that we introduced to the world.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:28.044
TENOCH HUERTA
For me, it's a dream.

00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:30.431
I never imagined playing this character.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:35.177
RUTH CARTER
Wakanda itself is such a concept.

00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:38.305
We really wanted to come 
back to it and groom it.

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:40.382
ANGELA BASSETT
Ruth just took it up a notch.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:45.538
She will exhaust every 
possibility to build this world.

00:00:45.673 --> 00:00:50.150
I know so much more of who 
I am when I put the costumes on.

00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:54.746
RAMONDA
Have I not given everything?

00:00:57.994 --> 00:00:59.751
ANGELA BASSETT
You want to take an audience on a journey.

00:01:01.781 --> 00:01:03.755
You got to grab them by the heart.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.765
LETITIA WRIGHT
You see the themes of family.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:17.753
Protection. Love. There's so 
much that's happening.

00:01:18.647 --> 00:01:19.871
RYAN COOGLER
Hopefully, you see something in it

00:01:20.421 --> 00:01:21.788
and it speaks to you personally.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.752
LETITIA WRIGHT
You got to keep inspiring people

00:01:25.802 --> 00:01:29.298
and I'm praying that will be 
the result of this movie.

00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:31.953
SHURI
Yibambe!

00:01:32.249 --> 00:01:33.187
ALL
Yibambe!

00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:34.164
SHURI
Yibambe!

00:01:34.286 --> 00:01:35.237
ALL
Yibambe!

